          "filename": "Air raid shelters - geograph.org.uk - 680624.jpg",
          "caption": "Air raid shelters Not unnaturally, the extensive Boots production site was provided with equally extensive air raid shelters. The available space on the site means that it has never been necessary to remove these to make way for newer development. The car parking area in the foreground was previously occupied by railway sidings.",
